  <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
    <h1 class="hero-headline display">
      Every hour your team<br>
      spends on paperwork<br>
      is an hour <em>a donor paid for.</em>
    </h1>
    <div class="hero-body">
      <p class="hero-desc">
        Your staff didn't get into this work to fill out forms. We find where the hours go. Intake, scheduling, grant reports, case notes. We build automations that recover them. Capacity Review at no cost. Operations Assessment in 24 hours.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#assessment" class="btn-pill btn-pill--lg" id="heroCtaBtn">
          Get Your Capacity Review
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-pill-outline">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
